    "sub_title": null,
    "sub_title_en": "For the subsidiary but an essential part of this course is English used for workplace that we will be discussing for the latter half of the semester. We will learning genres such as email writing and presentation skills that help you articulate for various purposes and types of audiences.",
    "sub_describe": null,
    "sub_describe_en": "We will continue to learn the English for workplace this semester. The skills of email writing and presentation will help students think and brand themselves as professionals in the workplace."
  },
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "永續與社會事業導讀",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO SUSTAINABILITY AND SOCIAL ENTERPRISES",
    "describe_ch": "課程旨在透過選讀、分析及討論永續發展和社會事業的概念、原則和實踐，協助學生了解永續發展和社會事業，提升專業英語閱讀能力，並促進發揮積極社會影響力。課程引導學生掌握關鍵詞彙，並培養跨領域的知識。 \r\n",
    "describe_eh": "The course aims to enhance students' understanding of sustainable development and social enterprises through the selection, analysis, and discussion of concepts, principles, and practices. It facilitates the improvement of students' professional English reading skills and promotes the ability to exert positive social impact. The course guides students in mastering key vocabulary and cultivating interdisciplinary knowledge. \r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "學生深入了解永續發展和社會企業的概念和範圍。",
      "describe_en": "Students gain insight into the concepts and scope of sustainable development and social enterprises.Students possess proficiency in professional English reading and oral presentation skills."
    }
  ],
