    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": null,
    "course_pol_en": "This course is co-taught by Professor Hui-Tzu Huang and Shao-wei Huang. Your final grade will be the average of the scores assigned by each instructor.\n\nGrading breakdown for Professor Shao-wei Huang's section:\n\nFinal Group Presentation: 50%\n\nClass Participation: 30% (Includes in-class tasks, homework, and class discussion)\n\nAttendance: 20%\n\nYour attendance score is based on your presence in class. If you need to excuse your absence, please provide valid evidence such as a doctor's note with the clinic or doctor's stamp, official document with your name on it.\n\nUnexcused absences will result in progressive deductions from your final module grade, calculated as follows:\n\n- 1st absence: 1 point deducted from your final grade\n\n- 2nd absence: 2 points deducted\n\n- 3rd absence: 3 points deducted (and so on...)\n\nAbsences exceeding 9 hours: Automatic failure for this course.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": null,
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>1.Students must exhibit honesty and ethical behavior in their academic activities, avoiding plagiarism and falsification of data.</div>\n\n<div>學生在學術活動中必須展現誠實和道德行為，避免抄襲和篡改資料。</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>2.Plagiarism: Proper citation of sources is required. Copying or using others&#39; work without appropriate attribution is considered plagiarism.</div>\n\n<div>抄襲的定義：必須適當引用來源。未經適當標示使用他人作品屬於抄襲行為。</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>3.Cheating: Following exam rules is mandatory. Unauthorized materials or collusion with others during exams is considered cheating.</div>\n\n<div>考試作弊：必須遵守考試規則，禁止使用未經授權的材料或與他人串通作弊。</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
